        "name": "Loop Over Items v7",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
        "typeVersion": 3,
        "position": [
          2896,
          -1216
        ],
        "notes": "Processes the folder in batches of 5. Keeps the Code node's base64 footprint small and, together with the batch-wide .all() lookup in 'Prepare AURON Payload1', avoids the paired-item tracing that made the task runner time out partway through a 223-file run."
      },
